{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "diagram_type": "explainer",
  "meta": {
    "id": "oci-whiteouts",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "title": "删的是下层：同层新增文件为什么还在？"
  },
  "answer": {
    "summary": "app/cache/new.txt 保留。归档内容是实测；可见结果是 OCI 规范推导，未运行容器。",
    "reasons": [
      "普通 whiteout 只隐藏下层指定目标。",
      "opaque 隐藏目录的下层子项，同层新文件仍保留。",
      "tar 中 marker 在前或在后，不改变这个范围。"
    ],
    "scope": "原创合成两层 · 仅六个 regular 成员 · 不是完整镜像或运行观测"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": "meaning",
      "title": "先分清归档成员与可见性",
      "span": 12,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "boundary",
          "type": "callout",
          "level": "warning",
          "title": "实测 inventory ≠ 实测容器文件系统",
          "text": "这两份小 tar 由本实验原创构造。visible 路径按固定 OCI 规范推导；没有执行 Docker、mount、解压或上游工具。"
        },
        {
          "id": "whiteout-map",
          "type": "diagram",
          "diagramType": "architecture",
          "source": "native.json",
          "nodeBlocks": {
            "opaque": "rule-opaque",
            "new": "rule-same-layer",
            "ordinary": "rule-explicit",
            "visible-new": "rule-same-layer"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rules",
      "title": "标记只作用于下层",
      "span": 12,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "rule-opaque",
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "**Opaque：** 仅隐藏 lower 中 cache 目录的子项与后代；此例 old 不可见，标记自身也不显示。[](source:oci-opaque)"
        },
        {
          "id": "rule-same-layer",
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "**同层 new：** upper 中 new.txt 先于 opaque 记录，仍然可见。六种 upper regular 成员排列的固定模型得到相同投影；这是规范规则的模型演示，不是六次容器运行。[](source:oci-whiteouts)"
        },
        {
          "id": "rule-explicit",
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "**普通 whiteout：** upper 中的标记只隐藏 lower 中对应的 config 文件；标记自身不可见，lower 归档原始字节保持不变。[](source:oci-whiteouts)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "projection",
      "title": "规范推导：哪些 regular 路径可见？",
      "span": 12,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "projection-table",
          "type": "comparison",
          "labelColumn": "路径",
          "columns": [
            "原始归档",
            "规范推导结果"
          ],
          "rows": [
            {
              "id": "p-config",
              "label": "app/config.txt",
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "lower"
                },
                {
                  "text": "不可见：普通 whiteout"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "p-old",
              "label": "app/cache/old.txt",
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "lower"
                },
                {
                  "text": "不可见：opaque 隐藏下层 children"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "p-new",
              "label": "app/cache/new.txt",
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "upper"
                },
                {
                  "text": "可见：同层新增，不被同层 opaque 隐藏"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "p-keep",
              "label": "app/keep.txt",
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "lower"
                },
                {
                  "text": "可见：无标记影响"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "p-markers",
              "label": "两份 whiteout 标记",
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "upper；空 payload"
                },
                {
                  "text": "标记自身不可见"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "projection-json",
          "type": "snippet",
          "language": "json",
          "title": "SPEC-DERIVED；不是 runtime filesystem",
          "text": "{\n  \"app/keep.txt\": \"lower\",\n  \"app/cache/new.txt\": \"upper\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "inventory",
      "title": "实际 tar 成员：目录、顺序与 payload 摘要",
      "span": 12,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "inventory-scope",
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "下列记录由标准库逐成员读取两份原创 tar；完整包含每层两个目录和三个 regular 成员。读取 payload 不向文件系统提取。归档长度包括 tar metadata/padding，不等于 payload 总和，也不是镜像压缩大小。"
        },
        {
          "id": "inventory-json",
          "type": "snippet",
          "language": "json",
          "title": "实际 inventory；顺序保留",
          "text": "{\n  \"lower\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"app\",\n      \"type\": \"directory\",\n      \"size\": 0,\n      \"payloadSha256\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"app/cache\",\n      \"type\": \"directory\",\n      \"size\": 0,\n      \"payloadSha256\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"app/config.txt\",\n      \"type\": \"regular\",\n      \"size\": 10,\n      \"payloadSha256\": \"fb4d01e88dcb199d055c31268146167f20ab6b34dde368277de25c766cd74aa9\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"app/cache/old.txt\",\n      \"type\": \"regular\",\n      \"size\": 10,\n      \"payloadSha256\": \"dedbb5907274af69e59a05472fa0069aaa25f597655fa453a170d6dae380e3fe\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"app/keep.txt\",\n      \"type\": \"regular\",\n      \"size\": 8,\n      \"payloadSha256\": \"60d8b5ad876211494154448e80a187a80db2bfc9a5b608fce966dfb286d9ec77\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"upper\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"app\",\n      \"type\": \"directory\",\n      \"size\": 0,\n      \"payloadSha256\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"app/cache\",\n      \"type\": \"directory\",\n      \"size\": 0,\n      \"payloadSha256\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"app/cache/new.txt\",\n      \"type\": \"regular\",\n      \"size\": 10,\n      \"payloadSha256\": \"e6402482646d8c43353d0439d52abaf6cc0edbb0db80fb6c21f497dca5f9da57\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"app/.wh.config.txt\",\n      \"type\": \"regular\",\n      \"size\": 0,\n      \"payloadSha256\": \"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"app/cache/.wh..wh..opq\",\n      \"type\": \"regular\",\n      \"size\": 0,\n      \"payloadSha256\": \"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
        },
        {
          "id": "order-json",
          "type": "snippet",
          "language": "json",
          "title": "六种顺序与固定规范模型；不是容器实跑",
          "text": "[\n  {\n    \"upperRegularOrder\": [\n      \"app/cache/new.txt\",\n      \"app/.wh.config.txt\",\n      \"app/cache/.wh..wh..opq\"\n    ],\n    \"tarSha256\": \"fc96ae9972d9ea3d17612c6e5797d574cb409f7809e42eba5f0b5c7a8b12cddc\",\n    \"projection\": {\n      \"app/keep.txt\": \"lower\",\n      \"app/cache/new.txt\": \"upper\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"upperRegularOrder\": [\n      \"app/cache/new.txt\",\n      \"app/cache/.wh..wh..opq\",\n      \"app/.wh.config.txt\"\n    ],\n    \"tarSha256\": \"ffd94e13b97bd6a113f8a6d88130151e0590ea92d25a8059875e0ffa6d4465d8\",\n    \"projection\": {\n      \"app/keep.txt\": \"lower\",\n      \"app/cache/new.txt\": \"upper\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"upperRegularOrder\": [\n      \"app/.wh.config.txt\",\n      \"app/cache/new.txt\",\n      \"app/cache/.wh..wh..opq\"\n    ],\n    \"tarSha256\": \"d1306362fed2906eb0d0c14e5dcb68131161c1fd9c2b77f05e6c14554a82fa1d\",\n    \"projection\": {\n      \"app/keep.txt\": \"lower\",\n      \"app/cache/new.txt\": \"upper\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"upperRegularOrder\": [\n      \"app/.wh.config.txt\",\n      \"app/cache/.wh..wh..opq\",\n      \"app/cache/new.txt\"\n    ],\n    \"tarSha256\": \"b2938b2e1e822fdab377747cbb34e7af3b35d553e247597e6f4e5c68b63ac5ae\",\n    \"projection\": {\n      \"app/keep.txt\": \"lower\",\n      \"app/cache/new.txt\": \"upper\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"upperRegularOrder\": [\n      \"app/cache/.wh..wh..opq\",\n      \"app/cache/new.txt\",\n      \"app/.wh.config.txt\"\n    ],\n    \"tarSha256\": \"62e53e82d63abe560667e3fb4790b67082ab8e6837f596c5c700c7ca0dc589d6\",\n    \"projection\": {\n      \"app/keep.txt\": \"lower\",\n      \"app/cache/new.txt\": \"upper\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"upperRegularOrder\": [\n      \"app/cache/.wh..wh..opq\",\n      \"app/.wh.config.txt\",\n      \"app/cache/new.txt\"\n    ],\n    \"tarSha256\": \"a34d311e65e5bc2c30ab2070334f4598bc00b63b5cdeeaf86200fbaf2827d2eb\",\n    \"projection\": {\n      \"app/keep.txt\": \"lower\",\n      \"app/cache/new.txt\": \"upper\"\n    }\n  }\n]"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
